vření se uloží.\",invalidJson:\"JSON není platný.\"},\n  en:{settings:\"Settings\",subtitle:\"Choose exactly what you want on your Lock Screen.\",saveHint:\"Settings are saved automatically when you close this screen.\",preview:\"Wallpaper preview\",previewWorking:\"Generating preview…\",previewHint:\"Preview uses your current changes even before they are saved.\",closePreview:\"Close preview\",quick:\"Quick setup\",minimal:\"Minimal\",minimalD:\"Weather, calendar, battery\",productivity:\"Productivity\",productivityD:\"Calendar, tasks, weather\",info:\"Information\",infoD:\"More data, finance, news\",all:\"Everything\",allD:\"Enable every module\",content:\"Content\",what:\"What to show\",modules:\"Modules\",order:\"Order\",calendarReminders:\"Calendar & reminders\",appearance:\"Appearance\",layout:\"Layout\",automatic:\"Automatic\",manual:\"Manual\",colorsFonts:\"Colors & fonts\",textsLocalization:\"Texts & localization\",weather:\"Weather\",sport:\"Sports\",f1:\"Formula 1\",f1Sub:\"Standalone module – move it independently from Calendar.\",f1Practice:\"Practice\",f1Qualifying:\"Qualifying\",f1Sprint:\"Sprint\",f1Race:\"Race\",finance:\"Finance\",otherModules:\"Other modules\",tools:\"Tools\",diagnostics:\"Diagnostics\",diagnosticsSub:\"Permission and online source status checked when settings opened.\",maintenance:\"Backup & maintenance\",whatSub:\"Enable or disable every module independently.\",orderSub:\"Order controls where modules appear on the wallpaper.\",display:\"Display\",days:\"Days to show\",maxItems:\"Maximum items per day\",hidePast:\"Hide past events\",undatedToday:\"Show undated tasks today\",calendars:\"Calendars\",reminderLists:\"Reminder lists\",noneCalendars:\"No calendars found.\",noneReminders:\"No reminder lists found.\",responsiveInfo:\"Automatic layout scales positions, fonts, icons and spacing to the current iPhone resolution.\",automation:\"Automatic\",adapt:\"Adapt to different iPhones\",compact:\"Compact mode\",compactD:\"Less spacing for more content\",autoFit:\"Automatically fit content\",autoFitD:\"If content overflows, the script reduces text and spacing.\",minScale:\"Minimum Auto Fit scale\",scale:\"Content scale\",position:\"Position\",alignment:\"Alignment\",left:\"Left\",center:\"Center\",right:\"Right\",contentStart:\"Content start Y\",sideMargin:\"Side margin\",spacing:\"Spacing\",lineSpacing:\"Line spacing\",blockSpacing:\"Block spacing\",iconSize:\"Icon size\",styleSub:\"Each content type can have its own color and size.\",styles:\"Styles\",dayHeader:\"Day header\",language:\"Language\",dateFormat:\"Date format\",customText:\"Custom text\",today:\"Today\",tomorrow:\"Tomorrow\",noEventsText:\"No-events text\",nameDayLabel:\"Name-day label\",nameDays:\"Name days\",country:\"Country\",autoLanguage:\"Automatic by language\",forecast:\"Forecast\",forecastDays:\"Forecast days\",showWeatherIcon:\"Show weather icon\",units:\"Units\",league:\"League\",team:\"Team / filter\",stocks:\"Stocks, comma separated\",crypto:\"Cryptocurrencies\",currencies:\"Currencies vs EUR\",note:\"Note\",custom:\"Custom text\",countdown:\"Countdown\",title:\"Title\",date:\"Date\",stepGoal:\"Daily step goal\",fitnessInfo:\"Real step data must be supplied by a Shortcut in LockScreenGenerator_steps.txt. Without it the fitness block stays hidden.\",newsTime:\"News & time\",rss:\"RSS feed\",cities:\"Cities, comma separated\",permissions:\"Permissions needed\",calendarPermission:\"Allow Calendar access for Scriptable.\",reminderPermission:\"Allow Reminders access for Scriptable.\",locationPermission:\"Allow Location access for weather.\",testedOpen:\"Tested when settings were opened.\",statusOK:\"OK\",statusOff:\"Disabled\",statusError:\"Error\",exportImport:\"Export / import settings\",jsonHint:\"Copy this JSON as a backup or paste a previously exported configuration here.\",exportSettings:\"Export current\",importSettings:\"Apply import\",resetAppearance:\"Reset appearance\",resetModules:\"Reset modules\",resetAll:\"Reset everything\",confirmReset:\"Do you really want to reset the selected settings?\",copied:\"Settings copied.\",imported:\"Import applied. It will be saved when you close settings.\",invalidJson:\"Invalid JSON.\"},\n  de:{settings:\"Einstellungen\",subtitle:\"Wähle genau aus, was auf deinem Sperrbildschirm angezeigt werden soll.\",saveHint:\"Die Einstellungen werden beim Schließen automatisch gespeichert.\",preview:\"Hintergrund-Vorschau\",previewWorking:\"Vorschau wird erstellt…\",previewHint:\"Die Vorschau verwendet auch noch nicht gespeicherte Änderungen.\",closePreview:\"Vorschau schließen\",quick:\"Schnelleinrichtung\",minimal:\"Minimal\",minimalD:\"Wetter, Kalender, Batterie\",productivity:\"Produktivität\",productivityD:\"Kalender, Aufgaben, Wetter\",info:\"Informationen\",infoD:\"Mehr Daten, Finanzen, Nachrichten\",all:\"Alles\",allD:\"Alle Module aktivieren\",content:\"Inhalt\",what:\"Was anzeigen\",modules:\"Module\",order:\"Reihenfolge\",calendarReminders:\"Kalender & Erinnerungen\",appearance:\"Darstellung\",layout:\"Layout\",automatic:\"Automatisch\",manual:\"Manuell\",colorsFonts:\"Farben & Schrift\",textsLocalization:\"Texte & Sprache\",weather:\"Wetter\",sport:\"Sport\",f1:\"Formel 1\",f1Sub:\"Eigenständiges Modul – unabhängig vom Kalender verschiebbar.\",f1Practice:\"Training\",f1Qualifying:\"Qualifying\",f1Sprint:\"Sprint\",f1Race:\"Rennen\",finance:\"Finanzen\",otherModules:\"Weitere Module\",tools:\"Werkzeuge\",diagnostics:\"Diagnose\",diagnosticsSub:\"Status von Berechtigungen und Online-Quellen beim Öffnen der Einstellungen.\",maintenance:\"Sicherung & Wartung\",whatSub:\"Jedes Modul kann separat aktiviert oder deaktiviert werden.\",orderSub:\"Die Reihenfolge bestimmt die Position der Module auf dem Hintergrund.\",display:\"Anzeige\",days:\"Anzuzeigende Tage\",maxItems:\"Maximale Einträge pro Tag\",hidePast:\"Vergangene Termine ausblenden\",undatedToday:\"Aufgaben ohne Datum heute anzeigen\",calendars:\"Kalender\",reminderLists:\"Erinnerungslis